
Output demo/config.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "export XDG_CONFIG_HOME=$PWD/demo/.config && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "coinfetch config"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "sol"
Sleep 1500ms

Tab
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 700ms

Type "q"
Sleep 1s
